# --- Generated railway datasets (rebuilt by CI, never hand-edited) ---
# Raw NTES crawl corpus is deliberately NOT committed: see docs/09-risks-legal.md
data/raw/
data/out/
data/tmp/
site/data/generated/
*.bin
*.pmtiles
tracks.geojson
# ...but DO commit small curated seed data
!site/data/seed/*.json

